cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "TA-WGAN-GP: Temporal-Aware Wasserstein GAN for Marine Wind-Power Scenario Generation"
abstract: >-
  A temporal-aware conditional Wasserstein GAN with gradient penalty that pairs a
  self-attention generator with paired spatial and temporal discriminators, for
  generating marine wind-power scenarios that preserve ramp and autocorrelation
  structure for shipboard energy-storage sizing.
